<title>FRANCE: Rouen Oct 1-23 grain exports at 408,529 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Oct 1-23 grain exports at 408,529 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 408,529 tonnes between October 1 and October 23, port officials said on Tuesday</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 547,000 tonnes in the whole of October 1995.</p>
<p>The 408,529 tonnes grain total included 368,385 tonnes of wheat and 40,144 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		     18,100</p>
<p>    Algeria			   50,612</p>
<p>    Cuba				54,458</p>
<p>    Egypt			     26,500</p>
<p>    Britain			    7,310</p>
<p>    Greece			    11,606</p>
<p>    Italy			     56,894</p>
<p>    Libya			     21,355</p>
<p>    Morocco			   88,300</p>
<p>    Poland			     2,950</p>
<p>    Tunisia			   30,300</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		    33,000</p>
<p>    Colombia			   7,144</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
